---@class anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsClaudeTagMetrics
---@field active_day_count number|distilled.Null 1 on a day the user was active in Claude Tag in Slack, otherwise 0. Summed over the window in date-range mode, so it is the number of active days; on grouped rows, the total of each member's active days. Null when Claude Tag data cannot be read for the request. Otherwise, 0 on a row filtered by project, and null on any other row when no covered day was measured.
