---@class anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsFlatCostGroup
---@field actor anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsReportActor|distilled.Null The identity the usage is attributed to: the user if one is attributed, else the service account, else the federated (cloud-platform) identity, else the API key. Populated only when `actor` is in `group_by[]`; null for usage with no attributable identity, and for users' and federated identities' usage when the reader is a member who can see only some workspaces. Distinct identities the server cannot render also read null, each as its own row.
---@field actor_type anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsActorType|distilled.Null Kind of identity the usage is attributed to; matches `actor.type` when `actor` is set. Populated only when `actor_type` is in `group_by[]`.
---@field agent_id string|distilled.Null Claude Managed Agents agent whose session incurred the usage. Populated only when `agent_id` is in `group_by[]`; null for usage outside a managed session.
---@field api_key_id string|distilled.Null API key that authenticated the requests, as a tagged API key ID, whichever identity `actor` resolves to. Populated only when `api_key_id` is in `group_by[]`; null for usage not authenticated by an API key.
---@field claude_tag_category anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsClaudeTagCategory|distilled.Null Claude Tag (Claude in Slack) spend category: `engaged` (a person addressed Claude in a channel or thread), `proactive` (Claude responded without being addressed), `scheduled` (a scheduled routine ran), `monitoring` (Claude watching a channel it was asked to monitor), or `dm` (direct messages with Claude). Populated only when `claude_tag_category` is in `group_by[]`; null for usage that is not Claude Tag. New categories may be added over time.
---@field claude_tag_user_id string|distilled.Null Slack user ID (for example `U0123ABCDEF`) of the member the Claude Tag (Claude in Slack) usage is attributed to, not a claude.ai user ID. Populated only when `claude_tag_user_id` is in `group_by[]`; null for usage that is not Claude Tag and for Claude Tag usage that is not attributed to a single user (for example `monitoring`, and `proactive` usage Claude initiated), so per-user rows can sum to less than the Claude Tag total. Cannot be combined with `group_by[]=rbac_group_id` or the `rbac_group_ids[]` filter.
---@field context_window anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaMessagesUsageReportContextWindow|distilled.Null Context-window pricing tier of the usage or cost. Null unless `context_window` is in `group_by[]`; it can also be null on grouped rows with no context-window tier, such as code execution.
---@field cost_type anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsUsageCostCostType|distilled.Null Cost component breakdown; null when returning the combined total.
---@field deployment_id string|distilled.Null Deployment that started the Claude Managed Agents session. Populated only when `deployment_id` is in `group_by[]`; null for usage outside a managed session and for sessions no deployment started.
---@field environment_id string|distilled.Null Claude Managed Agents environment the session ran in. Populated only when `environment_id` is in `group_by[]`; null for usage outside a managed session.
---@field inference_geo anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsUsageCostInferenceGeo|distilled.Null Inference region of the usage or cost. Null unless `inference_geo` is in `group_by[]`; it can also be null on grouped rows where the region is not set (the rows that `inference_geos[]=not_available` matches).
---@field model string|distilled.Null Model that produced the usage or cost, as a model name in the form the `models[]` filter accepts (for example, `claude-opus-5-5`). Null unless `model` is in `group_by[]`; it can also be null on grouped rows whose usage or cost is not attributed to a specific model, such as code execution.
---@field organization_id string|distilled.Null UUID of the child organization the usage belongs to, on a parent organization's report across its children. Null unless `organization_id` is in `group_by[]`.
---@field product string|distilled.Null Product surface that produced the usage or cost. Null unless product is in `group_by[]`; it can also be null on grouped rows whose usage cannot be attributed to a known surface. Values include `chat`, `claude_code`, `cowork`, `office_agent`, `claude_in_chrome`, `claude_design`, `claude_tag`, and `chat_cowork_unified`. `claude_tag` is Claude Tag, the Claude product in Slack. `chat_cowork_unified` is Chat and Cowork unified, Cowork's features inside claude.ai chat: chat and Cowork usage by a member who has it turned on is reported under this value instead of `chat` or `cowork`. It is accepted as a filter only where Chat and Cowork unified is available. Some unattributed usage is reported as "other".
---@field rbac_group_id string|distilled.Null RBAC group (team) the usage is attributed to, in the public tagged `rbac_group_...` spelling — the same spelling the activity resources use for this key, so the same team has one id across resources and it round-trips as an `rbac_group_ids[]` filter value. Populated only when `rbac_group_id` is in `group_by[]`. Any-membership semantics: a user in several groups contributes their full usage to each of those groups' rows, so the named-group rows overlap and their sum can exceed the org total. A null value is the single unassigned row: users in no group on that (UTC) day. For the true org total, run the same query without `group_by[]`.
---@field service_tier anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaUsageReportServiceTier|distilled.Null Service tier the usage was served at. Populated only when `service_tier` is in `group_by[]`; null for usage with no service tier (for example, code execution) and for Claude Enterprise usage.
---@field session_id string|distilled.Null Claude Managed Agents session that incurred the usage. Populated only when `session_id` is in `group_by[]`; null for usage outside a managed session.
---@field slack_channel_id string|distilled.Null Slack channel the usage originated from. Populated only when `slack_channel_id` is in `group_by[]`; null for usage outside Slack, for some Claude Tag usage that has no channel recorded, and for usage recorded before channel attribution was enabled.
---@field speed anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsSpeed|distilled.Null Inference speed mode of the usage or cost: `fast` or `standard`. Null unless `speed` is in `group_by[]`.
---@field token_type anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaCostReportTokenType|distilled.Null Token type when `cost_type` is `tokens`; null otherwise.
---@field user_profile_id string|distilled.Null User profile the usage was attributed to, as a tagged `uprof_` ID. Populated only when `user_profile_id` is in `group_by[]`; null for usage that named no profile and for Claude Enterprise usage.
---@field workspace_id string|distilled.Null Workspace the usage occurred in, as a tagged workspace ID, including the organization's default workspace. Populated only when `workspace_id` is in `group_by[]`; null for Claude Enterprise usage.

