---@field chat_cowork_unified_metrics? anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsPluginChatCoworkUnifiedMetrics|distilled.Null Plugin use recorded while members had Chat and Cowork unified (Cowork's features inside claude.ai chat) turned on. A count is null in date-range mode where it cannot be computed. Omitted from the response where Chat and Cowork unified is not available.
