---@field chat_metrics anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsChatMetrics
---@field claude_code_metrics anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsClaudeCodeMetrics
---@field claude_tag_metrics? anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsClaudeTagMetrics|distilled.Null Claude Tag activity in Slack by a user who has linked a Claude account. Activity by Slack users who have not linked an account appears only in the `/summaries` Claude Tag counts, so these rows do not add up to those counts. Omitted from the response on deployments that do not offer Claude Tag reporting.
---@field cowork_metrics anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsCoworkMetrics
---@field design_metrics anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsDesignMetrics
---@field distinct_user_count number|distilled.Null Number of distinct active users represented by this row. Only set for grouped rollups (`group_by[]`); null for per-user rows. In date-range mode, recomputed as an exact distinct count of the group's active members over the requested window, never a sum of per-day values.
---@field last_activity_date? string|distilled.Null Most recent UTC day (YYYY-MM-DD) on which the user had any counted activity, within the requested window: equal to the requested `date` in single-day mode, and to the latest active day from `starting_date` (inclusive) to `ending_date` (exclusive) in date-range rollup mode — never a day earlier than the window start. On filtered requests (`filter[]`) only days matching the filter count: with `filter[]=rbac_group_id:{id}` it is the last day the user was active while a member of that group, consistent with the row's other metrics. On grouped (`group_by[]`) rows it is the latest day any member of the group was active (the requested `date` in single-day mode). Omitted from the response while last-activity reporting is not enabled for this organization.
---@field office_metrics anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsOfficeMetrics
---@field rbac_group_id? string|distilled.Null Tagged RBAC group identifier (`rbac_group_...`), matching the spend-limits API spelling. Present only when the request grouped by `rbac_group_id`.
---@field rbac_group_name? string|distilled.Null Resolved RBAC group display name, alongside `rbac_group_id` when name resolution is available. Null if the group has been deleted or its name could not be resolved; `rbac_group_id` remains the stable key.
---@field science_metrics anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsScienceMetrics
---@field user anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsUser|distilled.Null The user this row describes. Null on rows aggregated across users.
