---Authorization rule binding an external OIDC identity to Anthropic.
---
---Evaluates the match conditions and mints an OAuth access token for the
---resolved target, scoped to a single workspace where the rule is enabled
---(chosen by the caller at exchange time when the rule is enabled for more
---than one). For rules enabled via `workspace_ids` or
---`applies_to_all_workspaces`, the target service account must be a member
---of that workspace (it is implicitly a member of the default workspace);
---rules carrying only the legacy `workspace_id` binding do not enforce
---this.
---@class anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaFederationRule
---@field applies_to_all_workspaces boolean When true, this rule is enabled for every workspace in the org (including ones created after the rule). `workspace_ids` is ignored at exchange time.
---@field archived_at string|distilled.Null If set, this rule is archived and rejects token exchange.
---@field archived_by_actor_id string|distilled.Null Tagged ID (`user_`/`svac_`) of the actor that archived this rule.
---@field attributes anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaFederationRuleAttributesMap|distilled.Null CEL expressions extracting named values from claims. Not yet supported; always null.
---@field created_at string When this rule was created.
---@field created_by_actor_id string|distilled.Null Tagged ID (`user_`/`svac_`) of the actor that created this rule.
---@field description string|distilled.Null Optional free-text description.
---@field id string Tagged ID of the federation rule.
---@field issuer_id string Tagged ID of the issuer whose tokens this rule accepts.
---@field issuer_name string|distilled.Null Issuer's display name at read time.
---@field match anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaRuleMatch Conditions the verified JWT must satisfy for this rule to apply. All populated matcher fields must pass.
---@field name string Admin-chosen slug identifier.
---@field oauth_scope string Space-separated OAuth scopes granted on the minted token.
---@field target anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaServiceAccountTarget What this rule targets. Check `type` before reading the other fields. Tokens minted via a rule whose target `type` is `service_account` act as that service account.
---@field token_lifetime_seconds number Lifetime in seconds of access tokens minted via this rule. Minted tokens are capped at `max(60, min(this value, 2 × remaining assertion validity))` seconds.
---@field type string
---@field updated_at string When this rule was last updated.
---@field updated_by_actor_id string|distilled.Null Tagged ID (`user_`/`svac_`) of the actor that last updated this rule.
---@field workspace_id string|distilled.Null Legacy single-workspace binding. Prefer `workspace_ids` and the `/federation_rules/{federation_rule_id}/workspaces` sub-resource for managing workspace enablement.
---@field workspace_ids anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaFederationRuleWorkspaceIdsList Tagged IDs of the workspaces this rule is enabled for. May be empty for older rules that only carry the legacy `workspace_id` binding. Ignored at exchange time when `applies_to_all_workspaces` is true (the list may still be non-empty).

