---@class anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaPluginVersion
---@field components anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaPluginVersionComponentsList|distilled.Null What the version contains; null when not enumerated.
---@field content_scan anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaPluginContentScan|distilled.Null This version's content scan; null when it has not been scanned.
