---@class anthropic.beta_organizations.CreateWorkspaceRequest
---@field anthropicBeta? anthropic.beta_organizations.CreateWorkspaceRequestAnthropicBetaList Optional header to specify the beta version(s) you want to use.
---@field anthropicVersion? string The version of the Claude API you want to use. Read more about versioning and our version history [here](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/versioning).
