---@field limit? number Number of rows per page (1-1000, default 20). `cost_type`/`token_type` fan-out rows (cost endpoint only) do not count toward this limit, so `data` can exceed it.
---@field page? string Opaque cursor from a previous response's `next_page` field.
---@field order_by? anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaAnalyticsFlatUsageOrderBy|string Row order. A metric ranks rows by that metric in the `order` direction. `time` orders rows by time bucket in the `order` direction (newest first by default) and, within a bucket, by `total_tokens`, highest first. `time` takes effect only with `time_bucket_width`; without it, `time` is the same as `total_tokens`. Defaults to `total_tokens`.
---@field group_by__? anthropic.beta_organizations.GetAnalyticsUsageRequestGroupByList Dimensions to break usage out by (at most 5): one row per combination of their values with usage in the range (and per time bucket, when `time_bucket_width` is set), every combination returned across pages rather than a capped top set. When omitted, a single row aggregates the whole range.
---@field anthropicVersion? string The version of the Claude API you want to use. Read more about versioning and our version history [here](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/versioning).
