---@class anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateFederationIssuerRequest
---@field federation_issuer_id string ID of the federation issuer to update.
---@field anthropicBeta? anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateFederationIssuerRequestAnthropicBetaList Optional header to specify the beta version(s) you want to use.
---@field anthropicVersion? string The version of the Claude API you want to use. Read more about versioning and our version history [here](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/versioning).
---@field check_jti? boolean|distilled.Null Whether the jwt-bearer exchange enforces JTI single-use (replay protection) for tokens from this issuer. Applies only to assertions carrying a `jti` claim; tokens without one are accepted without single-use enforcement.
---@field issuer_url? string|distilled.Null Replaces the `iss` claim value to match against. For discovery-mode issuers without a `discovery_base`, this is also the URL Anthropic fetches the OIDC discovery document and signing keys from, so changing it repoints the JWKS source. Changing the issuer URL to a well-known shared platform is rejected while any live rule under this issuer would not constrain tenant identity.
---@field jwks? anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateFederationIssuerRequestJwks|distilled.Null Replaces the entire JWKS configuration.
---@field jwks_polling_disabled? boolean|distilled.Null Only `false` is accepted, to re-enable polling after the system pauses it. Polling is paused automatically; sending `true` is rejected.
---@field max_jwt_lifetime_seconds? number|distilled.Null Maximum allowed iat→exp spread for assertions from this issuer (1-176400 seconds, i.e. up to 49h). Assertions must carry both `iat` and `exp`; a missing `iat` is rejected.
---@field name? string|distilled.Null Replaces the slug identifier (lowercase, digits, hyphens). Unique within the organization; a duplicate name returns 409.

---Optional header to specify the beta version(s) you want to use.
---@alias anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateFederationIssuerRequestAnthropicBetaList anthropic.beta_organizations.AnthropicBeta[]

---@alias anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateFederationIssuerRequestJwks anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaJwksDiscovery|anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaJwksExplicitUrl|anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaJwksInline

---@class anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateFederationRuleRequest
---@field federation_rule_id string ID of the federation rule to update.
---@field anthropicBeta? anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateFederationRuleRequestAnthropicBetaList Optional header to specify the beta version(s) you want to use.
---@field anthropicVersion? string The version of the Claude API you want to use. Read more about versioning and our version history [here](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/versioning).
---@field applies_to_all_workspaces? boolean|distilled.Null When true, enables this rule for every workspace in the org (including workspaces created later). Setting `false` is rejected with 400 if no workspace would remain enabled; a rule with only a legacy `workspace_id` binding continues to mint.
---@field attributes? anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateFederationRuleRequestAttributesMap|distilled.Null Replaces the CEL expressions `{name: expr}` extracting named values from claims. Send null to clear them. Not yet supported; any non-empty value is rejected with 400.
---@field description? string|distilled.Null Replaces the description. Omit to leave unchanged; send `null` to clear (the field is stored as an empty string).
---@field match? anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaRuleMatch|distilled.Null Replaces the entire match object. All populated matcher fields must pass.
---@field name? string|distilled.Null Replaces the slug identifier (lowercase, digits, hyphens). Unique within the organization; a duplicate name returns 409.
---@field oauth_scope? string|distilled.Null Replaces the space-separated OAuth scopes granted on minted tokens. OAuth callers may only set `workspace:developer` or `workspace:inference`; other scopes (such as `org:admin`) require a Console session.
---@field target? anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaServiceAccountTarget|distilled.Null Replaces the entire target object. Currently always a `service_account` target.
---@field token_lifetime_seconds? number|distilled.Null Replaces the lifetime in seconds for access tokens minted via this rule (60-86400). Minted tokens are capped at `max(60, min(this value, 2 × remaining assertion validity))` seconds.
---@field workspace_id? string|distilled.Null Replaces the existing single workspace enablement (the previous one is removed). Rejected with 400 if the rule is enabled for more than one workspace; use the `/federation_rules/{federation_rule_id}/workspaces` sub-resource instead.

---Optional header to specify the beta version(s) you want to use.
---@alias anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateFederationRuleRequestAnthropicBetaList anthropic.beta_organizations.AnthropicBeta[]

---@alias anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateFederationRuleRequestAttributesMap { [string]: string }

