---@field display_name? string|distilled.Null New human-readable name, 1 to 255 characters. Null clears it.
---@field endpoint_url? string The new base URL of the destination's OTLP/HTTP endpoint. The same rules as on create apply. A change of hostname or port first removes every registered header, so send the headers for the new endpoint in the same request. When the destination has a `traces.endpoint_url`, such a change must also set `traces.endpoint_url` to a URL with the new hostname and port, or to `null`. A change of the path alone keeps the headers.
---@field headers? anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateTelemetryDestinationRequestHeadersMap|distilled.Null Headers to set or remove. The API merges them into the destination's headers by name. Names compare case-insensitively. A string value sets or replaces that header. A `null` value removes it. Headers that you omit don't change. The field itself can't be `null`. A request that sets a header value must also include `endpoint_url`. The current URL is accepted. The resulting set must stay within the same limits as on create. When the request sets a value, each stored value that it doesn't set counts as 4,096 bytes toward the 16,384-byte limit, because you can't read its real length. So to change one header of a destination that has four or more other headers, send the values of the others again in the same request.
---@field traces? anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaTelemetryDestinationTracesParams|distilled.Null The traces settings to change. Omitted settings keep their stored values. `null` sets every traces setting to its create default.
---@field state? anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaTelemetryDestinationStateParams Whether the destination receives deliveries after the update. The field can't be `null`.
---@field workspaces? anthropic.beta_organizations.BetaTelemetryDestinationWorkspacesParams The new workspace scope, in the same form as on create. The field can't be `null`. The API refuses an update that changes the type or sends `workspace_ids` while the destination's list has more than 750 workspaces. Remove workspaces one at a time until 750 or fewer remain, then send the update again.

---This endpoint is in beta: requests must send `telemetry-destinations-2026-08-11` in this header.
---@alias anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateTelemetryDestinationRequestAnthropicBetaList anthropic.beta_organizations.AnthropicBeta[]

---@alias anthropic.beta_organizations.UpdateTelemetryDestinationRequestHeadersMap { [string]: string|distilled.Null }

