---@field archive distilled.File|string A .zip of the marketplace directory (its contents at the root, or wrapped in one folder as a Git host's download produces), sent as a file part with a filename; DEFLATE- or STORE-compressed, at most 32 MB. A part sent without a filename, a second archive part, or any other form field is a 400; a larger archive is a 413.

